section.features#features
  .container
    header.features__header
      .features__header-title Grace
      .features__header-subtitle Onboarding the next generation of Web3 applications and blockchains
      .separate-line
      .features__header-subtitle Seamless multi-chain experience
    .features__content
      .features__item
        .features__item-img
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/content/features-1.png') alt="features-1")
        .features__item-content
          span.features__item-title Limitless Potential
          p.features__item-text Truly unique ecosystem perspective spanning the universe of dApps. Whether you're sending money securely, purchasing and selling tickets, exploring digital art marketplaces, or developing gaming universes to unlock GameFi opportunities. From Enterprise and Gaming to Education, DeFi, and Security, ensuring comprehensive application across diverse domains.
      .features__item.reverse
        .features__item-img
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/content/features-2.png') alt="features-2")
        .features__item-content
          span.features__item-title Globally Scalable
          p.features__item-text In response to web3's skyrocketing demand, blockchains must expand like the digital universe, effortlessly handling countless transactions and data delivery. Our ultimate goal is to do so without compromising security and speed. 
      .features__item
        .features__item-img
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/content/features-3.png') alt="features-3")
        .features__item-content
          span.features__item-title Safeguarded Secure
          p.features__item-text Conducted top-tier audits and stress-tested networks security demonstrated through practical implementation. When it concerns security, we remain confident in our commitment to the higheststandards and never compromising safety.
      .features__item.reverse
        .features__item-img
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/content/features-4.png') alt="features-4")
        .features__item-content
          span.features__item-title Cost-Effectiveness++
          p.features__item-text Count on the arrival time of every data packet being predetermined and assured. Ensuring information travels consistently and predictably makes it easy to fit for mass adoption blockchains and dApps. Thus maximizing return on investment and profitability while guaranteeing permanent token price growth.
      .features__item
        .features__item-img
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/content/features-5.png') alt="features-5")
        .features__item-content
          span.features__item-title Multi-Chain Communication
          p.features__item-text At its heart, it's all about fostering speed of connections and sharing information between diverse blockchain networks, making collaboration across different ecosystems a breeze. Our focus is on ensuring your data travels fast, securely and reliably maintaining its integrity and authenticity every step of the way.
      .features__item.reverse
        .features__item-img
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/content/features-6.png') alt="features-6")
        .features__item-content
          span.features__item-title Innovation Driven Speed
          p.features__item-text Our goal is to support the rapid growth of the blockchain industry by offering a fastest, secure, and efficient data transmission solution. It aims to unlock new possibilities for decentralised applications and platforms, revolutionising blockchain connectivity and drive the next wave of digital evolution thanks to computational integrity with advanced mathematical models and cryptography that provides unlimited scale.

